{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S01、S06等段的静态感受文字较密，扫读负担明显高于Y；虽然分时出现的设计缓解了一部分，但仍有信息拥挤的问题。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然更难快速扫完，但【】突出叙事转折，分时出现的感受又能跟随音乐展开，人物心理和音乐变化之间的对应更具体。尤其是S09，X保留了他究竟舍不得亲近，还是害怕孤单到愿意重新忍受委屈的尖锐矛盾，Y则把它概括成想有人陪，削弱了人物动机的复杂性。Y更清爽，但X在情绪递进、前后呼应和音乐感受的细腻程度上提供了更多真正有价值的信息。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "514a774c-d7c2-416e-8502-b0d87af4af5c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T232437118262Z", "elapsed_seconds": 88.469, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:26:05.609239+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0f27ad3cb792e6d4a9f3a53e9bdd2aee815fda3e5eb6eba05788ca5ad7d8f931", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachment